  <metadata>
    <name>2026 JTBC Seoul Marathon - Full 42.195 km (approximate)</name>
    <desc>APPROXIMATE track. Route order from the official 2026 course map and the official traffic-control page (intersection km list), routed along OpenStreetMap main roads, then shortened to the shortest line within 10 m of the road centreline (course-measurement style). ele = mean of Open Topo Data SRTM30m and ASTER30m, 30th-percentile filtered and smoothed (sigma 200 m); Jamsil Bridge deck interpolated between its banks. No official GPX or elevation profile was published as of 2026-10-25. Route data derived in part from OpenStreetMap (ODbL).</desc>
    <link href="http://marathon.jtbc.com/17/?bmode=view&amp;idx=175063425"><text>Official 2026 course notice</text></link>
    <time>2026-10-25T00:00:00Z</time>
  </metadata>
